---
// Amigo Hero Section - Multi-Agent Framework
---

<section class='relative isolate pt-14 pb-20 px-6 bg-meg-bg-dark border-b border-meg-border-dark'>
  <div class='absolute inset-x-0 -top-40 -z-10 transform-gpu overflow-hidden blur-3xl sm:-top-80' aria-hidden='true'>
    <div
      class='relative left-[calc(50%-11rem)] aspect-1155/678 w-[36.125rem] -translate-x-1/2 rotate-[30deg] bg-gradient-to-tr from-amber-400/20 to-orange-500/20 opacity-30 sm:left-[calc(50%-30rem)] sm:w-[72.1875rem]'
      style='clip-path: polygon(74.1% 44.1%, 100% 61.6%, 97.5% 26.9%, 85.5% 0.1%, 80.7% 2%, 72.5% 32.5%, 60.2% 62.4%, 52.4% 68.1%, 47.5% 58.3%, 45.2% 34.5%, 27.5% 76.7%, 0.1% 64.9%, 17.9% 100%, 27.6% 76.8%, 76.1% 97.7%, 74.1% 44.1%)'></div>
  </div>

  <div class='mx-auto max-w-7xl'>
    <div class='mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center'>
      <!-- Badge -->
      <div class='gsap-fadein mb-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-meg-surface-dark border border-meg-border-dark shadow-sm'>
        <i class='fa-solid fa-robot text-amber-400' aria-hidden='true'></i>
        <span class='text-meg-text-primary-dark font-bold text-sm tracking-tight'>Autonomous Multi-Agent Framework</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Headline -->
      <h1 class='gsap-fadein text-5xl md:text-8xl font-black tracking-tighter text-meg-text-primary-dark mb-2' style='animation-delay: 0.15s'>
        Amigo
      </h1>
      <p class="gsap-fadein text-sm font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-amber-500/80 mb-6" style='animation-delay: 0.2s'>
        Autonomous Multi-agent Interface in Go
      </p>

      <p class='gsap-fadein text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-8' style='animation-delay: 0.3s'>
        <span class='text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 to-orange-500'>
          Ihr autonomes Team aus KI-Agenten. Entwickelt in Go.
        </span>
      </p>

      <!-- Subheadline -->
      <p class='gsap-fadein text-xl md:text-2xl text-meg-text-secondary mb-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed' style='animation-delay: 0.45s'>
        Amigo ist ein hochperformantes Framework zur Orchestrierung spezialisierter Agenten (Architects, Developers, QA). Mit nativer MCP-Unterstützung und Multi-Provider Fallback ist es die Schaltzentrale für Ihre KI-gestützte Softwareentwicklung.
      </p>

      <!-- CTA Buttons -->
      <div class='gsap-fadein flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center' style='animation-delay: 0.6s'>
        <a 
          href='https://github.com/Waldheim-dev/amigo' 
          class='gsap-btn w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-500 text-black font-bold text-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-amber-500/20 transition-all hover:scale-[1.02]'
          aria-label='Amigo auf GitHub ansehen'
        >
          <i class='fa-brands fa-github' aria-hidden='true'></i>
          GitHub Repository
        </a>
        <a 
          href='#features' 
          class='gsap-btn w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl bg-meg-surface-dark border border-meg-border-dark text-meg-text-primary-dark font-bold text-lg hover:bg-meg-surface-dark hover:border-amber-500/50 transition-all'
          aria-label='Zu den Amigo Features springen'
        >
          <i class='fa-solid fa-layer-group' aria-hidden='true'></i>
          Features entdecken
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Tech Highlights -->
      <div class='gsap-fadein mt-16 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6 text-meg-text-secondary text-sm' style='animation-delay: 0.75s'>
        {[
          { icon: 'fa-brain', text: 'Advanced Reasoning Loops' },
          { icon: 'fa-plug', text: 'MCP Ready' },
          { icon: 'fa-gauge-high', text: 'Built in Go for Speed' },
          { icon: 'fa-shield-halved', text: 'Reliability: Circuit Breaker & DLQ' }
        ].map(item => (
          <div class='flex items-center gap-2 bg-meg-surface-dark/50 border border-meg-border-dark px-4 py-2 rounded-xl shadow-sm'>
            <i class={`fa-solid ${item.icon} text-amber-400`} aria-hidden='true'></i>
            <span class="font-semibold">{item.text}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
